AzaleaTown_KurtsHouse_Text_Request::
    .string "ELM told me about your work.\n"
    .string "I need your help at the well.\p"
    .string "ROCKET remnants are taking\n"
    .string "SLOWPOKE tails to sell.\p"
    .string "They came here after their\n"
    .string "KANTO operation fell apart.\p"
    .string "Please stop them, then tell me\n"
    .string "whether the SLOWPOKE are safe.$"

AzaleaTown_KurtsHouse_Text_Wait::
    .string "The well is in the northeast.\n"
    .string "Please check on the SLOWPOKE.$"

AzaleaTown_KurtsHouse_Text_BeforeElm::
    .string "Deliver MR. POKEMON's notes\n"
    .string "to ELM before you help me.$"

AzaleaTown_KurtsHouse_Text_Report::
    .string "You drove the ROCKETS away!\n"
    .string "The SLOWPOKE are safe again.\p"
    .string "I will send ELM your findings.\n"
    .string "BUGSY will hear of them too.$"

AzaleaTown_KurtsHouse_Text_After::
    .string "The GYM is ready for you now.\n"
    .string "BUGSY is a careful researcher.\p"
    .string "NET BALLS suit BUG and WATER\n"
    .string "POKEMON. Take good care of them.$"

AzaleaTown_KurtsHouse_Text_BagFull::
    .string "Your report has been accepted.\n"
    .string "BUGSY can challenge you now.\p"
    .string "Please make room for three\n"
    .string "NET BALLS. I will keep them.$"

AzaleaTown_KurtsHouse_Text_Granddaughter::
    .string "Grandpa will tell ELM what\n"
    .string "you learned at the well.$"

